lso done some of my favorite pieces for <i>Demon</i>.<br /> <br /> Check him out on his <a href=\"http://andrewtrabbold.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Tumblr</a>!</div> </div> </div> </div>Wow so he did all the Temakh as well and is the same one that did that fantastic illustration for the Heirs to Hell Cover, nice. Please someone sign him up for Sothis.<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4055-felipe","name":"Felipe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4055_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"538"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-07T17:40:44-08:00","id":306262,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Felipe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/303591-secrets-of-the-book-of-the-deceived?p=306182#post306182\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">the habit that mummy had to devour people to be whole.</div> </div> </div> </div>Huh. I never looked at it like that. I justified it that his Sekhem dropped, and thus his sahu formed, coincidentally every time he killed one of the American robbers","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/638-reseru","name":"reseru","avatar":"ht